  "description": "A complete .NET 9 client library for MercadoBitcoin API v4 with native HTTP/2 support and System.Text.Json. Provides access to all public and private endpoints including trading, wallet operations, and account management. Features HTTP/2 by default for maximum performance, retry policies with Polly, comprehensive test suite (59 tests), and clean architecture with AOT compatibility.",
