  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - BREAKING CHANGES:\n• Migrated from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json with Source Generators\n• Improved performance up to 2.1x faster serialization\n• Added AOT (Ahead-of-Time) compilation support\n• Comprehensive test suite with 59 tests covering all endpoints\n• Enhanced error handling and authentication management\n• Updated to .NET 9 and C# 13\n• HTTP/2 native support maintained\n• Breaking: JSON serialization behavior may differ from v1.x\n• Breaking: Some property names now use snake_case in JSON\n• Migration guide available in README",
